            For exterior brick walls and chimneys, Ghostshield Siloxa-Tek 8500 is the best all-around sealer, and Masonry Defender and Foundation Armor SX5000 WB are cheaper water-based alternatives that do the same breathable job. DRYLOK Natural Look is the convenient chimney pick straight off a home center shelf, while Seal-Krete Clear-Seal belongs indoors, where its sheen helps instead of trapping moisture.
          </p>
